      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>The destination delivery handover for two‑wheelers and motorcycles is a critical checkpoint that guarantees the vehicle arrives in the exact condition documented at pickup.</p>
